        <head>EXAMINEE. FRIDAY, OCTOBER 12 1900.</head>
        <p>THE EXAMINEE. FRIDAY, OCTOBER 12 1900.</p>
        <p>balecs up vrmatt creatp.</p>
        <p>SOIIOF lELD'S CORN CURB; safe and certain 40. LABORITORr. Ashbrook street. Openshavr, Manchester.</p>
