        <head>ARCHITECT AND SURVEYOR.</head>
        <p>ARCHITECT AND SURVEYOR.</p>
        <p>/VTR. C. R. BURTON BEGS to INFORM his _L FRIENDS and the PUBLIC, that after being fifteen years PRINCIPAL ASSI iTANT to the LATE JOH N EDWARD ,WRIGHT, Esq., ARCIIITECT, HAS COMMENCED BUSINESS IN MILL STREET CHAMHERS, WARRINGTON. and will be pleased to execute any Commission entrusted to him in an efficient manner and at reasonable charges. September Bth, 190.</p>
